# Excluded (not vendored; list is exhaustive)

Executables and tool sources, because the fleet installs no third-party executables:
- skills/poteto-mode/scripts/        bun/TypeScript tools (watch-pr, ship-pr, orch, bootstrap.ts, resume.mjs, check-plan.mjs, check-playbooks.mjs, worktree-audit.mjs, codex-session-effort.mjs) and their lockfiles
- skills/statechart/scripts/         bun/TypeScript statechart compiler, its `statechart` launcher, TLA+/dot/mermaid test corpus
- skills/setup-pstack/scripts/       shell and awk (check-sheet.sh, read-sheet.sh, sheet.awk, check-sheet.awk)
- skills/reflect/scripts/            node scripts (find-transcript.mjs, claude-project-dir.mjs)
- skills/show-me-your-work/scripts/  shell (log.sh)
Skills that name those scripts (poteto-mode, statechart, setup-pstack, reflect, show-me-your-work, recall, automate-me) still carry the references; the scripts are absent, so those steps cannot run here.

Everything else in the source repo, because it is not a skill:
- plugins/pstack/hooks/              SessionStart routing hook, pre-tool-use hook (shell/awk/ps1)
- plugins/pstack/agents/             subagent definitions (poteto-agent, comment-sicko, thermo-nuclear-*)
- plugins/pstack/pi/, models.json, .codex-plugin/, .muse-plugin/, .claude-plugin/, assets/
- tools/, tests/, tla/, lean/, .github/, package.json, bun.lock, bunfig.toml, CHANGES.md, CONTRIBUTING.md, docs/, plugin READMEs

